    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up, gear up, and face the relentless horrors that emerge each night. In this co-op survival shooter, you and your squad must endure as many days as possible against waves of terrifying, unnamed creatures. Scavenge, upgrade, and fight together\u2014or test your skills in PvP mode, where players compete to prove who\u2019s the ultimate slayer. With every passing day, the threats grow stronger. How long can you survive the unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/11de2b4b394ccbb5f9fadb51d1e902e3.webp?t=1755288114\" width=361 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/aa22aee2adead407ac35c5329e075fef.poster.avif?t=1755288114\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/aa22aee2adead407ac35c5329e075fef.webm?t=1755288114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/aa22aee2adead407ac35c5329e075fef.mp4?t=1755288114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with up to three other players to survive the day, but be careful who you trust. Coordinate your defense, scavenge supplies, and fight back the horrors together. Just remember: <strong>everything can kill you here, even your own squad.</strong> Friendly fire is always on, and one bad shot can be fatal. Stay sharp, communicate well, and watch each other\u2019s backs, or become the next mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/e0e8bbc803ff7011003156994e0438b2.webp?t=1755288114\" width=353 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/0feea46e78c007be96c2ae3d8f249d84.poster.avif?t=1755288114\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/0feea46e78c007be96c2ae3d8f249d84.webm?t=1755288114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/0feea46e78c007be96c2ae3d8f249d84.mp4?t=1755288114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ultimate test of skill, strategy, and nerve. In PvP mode, players face off in deadly matches where survival isn\u2019t just about pride\u2014it\u2019s about profit. <strong>Enter wager matches where everyone bets in-game currency, and the last one standing takes it all.</strong> Fight through the same horrifying environments, but now every player is a potential killer. Outmaneuver the monster, and each other, as you scavenge, ambush, and dominate your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No friends. No second chances. Just you, the chaos, and everything to lose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/8c0463949879c55d1ddcd6411ec8c6a2.webp?t=1755288114\" width=360 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival has its rewards. Earn in-game currency by lasting through brutal co-op nights, completing objectives, and scavenging rare resources. Then head to the Shop, your lifeline before every PvP match. <strong>Buy weapons, gear, gadgets, and upgrades to gain the edge over your rivals.</strong> Whether you're investing in raw firepower, clever traps, or tactical tools, your loadout can make the difference between walking away rich, or not walking away at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend wisely. Fight smart. Win big.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up, gear up, and face the relentless horrors that emerge each night. In this co-op survival shooter, you and your squad must endure as many days as possible against waves of terrifying, unnamed creatures. Scavenge, upgrade, and fight together\u2014or test your skills in PvP mode, where players compete to prove who\u2019s the ultimate slayer. With every passing day, the threats grow stronger. How long can you survive the unknown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/11de2b4b394ccbb5f9fadb51d1e902e3.webp?t=1755288114\" width=361 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/aa22aee2adead407ac35c5329e075fef.poster.avif?t=1755288114\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/aa22aee2adead407ac35c5329e075fef.webm?t=1755288114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/aa22aee2adead407ac35c5329e075fef.mp4?t=1755288114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with up to three other players to survive the day, but be careful who you trust. Coordinate your defense, scavenge supplies, and fight back the horrors together. Just remember: <strong>everything can kill you here, even your own squad.</strong> Friendly fire is always on, and one bad shot can be fatal. Stay sharp, communicate well, and watch each other\u2019s backs, or become the next mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/e0e8bbc803ff7011003156994e0438b2.webp?t=1755288114\" width=353 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/0feea46e78c007be96c2ae3d8f249d84.poster.avif?t=1755288114\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/0feea46e78c007be96c2ae3d8f249d84.webm?t=1755288114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/0feea46e78c007be96c2ae3d8f249d84.mp4?t=1755288114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ultimate test of skill, strategy, and nerve. In PvP mode, players face off in deadly matches where survival isn\u2019t just about pride\u2014it\u2019s about profit. <strong>Enter wager matches where everyone bets in-game currency, and the last one standing takes it all.</strong> Fight through the same horrifying environments, but now every player is a potential killer. Outmaneuver the monster, and each other, as you scavenge, ambush, and dominate your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No friends. No second chances. Just you, the chaos, and everything to lose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722740/extras/8c0463949879c55d1ddcd6411ec8c6a2.webp?t=1755288114\" width=360 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival has its rewards. Earn in-game currency by lasting through brutal co-op nights, completing objectives, and scavenging rare resources. Then head to the Shop, your lifeline before every PvP match. <strong>Buy weapons, gear, gadgets, and upgrades to gain the edge over your rivals.</strong> Whether you're investing in raw firepower, clever traps, or tactical tools, your loadout can make the difference between walking away rich, or not walking away at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend wisely. Fight smart. Win big.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
